nvidia-legacy-470xx-driver is a metapackage. It pulls in the runtime
libraries, the Xorg driver, the utilities, the kernel-support glue and (for the
DKMS flavour) the DKMS module source for NVIDIA 470.256.02.

Hardware: Kepler (GeForce 600/700 series)
Upstream status: Upstream EOL 2024-Q3. Community-patched for newer kernels (see joanbm).

To remove every trace:  apt purge '~nnvidia-legacy-470xx-.*'
